  "description": "The textual phrase 'i wish i was your baby..' is projected onto the visual entity 'young_man'. The text implies that the speaker (the person who wrote the text) desires to be the young man's baby, thereby mapping the speaker's identity or desire onto the visual representation of the young man. This is an analogical mapping where the text explicitly refers to the visual entity as the desired object of the speaker's fantasy.",
